%% Revenue growth issue tree: four levers, each split into sub-levers and first moves.
# Grow Revenue 30% Next Year

## Win new customers
- More qualified pipeline
  - Partner referrals
  - Outbound to freight firms
- Higher win rate
  - Faster security review
- Shorter sales cycle

## Expand existing accounts
- More seats per account
  - Team-wide rollout offer
- Cross-sell add-ons
  - Analytics module
  - API access tier
- Upgrade to higher plan

## Keep the customers we have
- Faster onboarding
  - First value within 14 days
- Proactive health checks
- Fewer support escalations

## Raise price realization
- Annual price uplift
- Less discounting
  - Deal desk above 15% off
- Usage-based overage
